  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DRA ACJR Mozambique 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mozambique was hit by 3 subsequent cyclones. In Cabo Delgado region this exacerbated the already precarious humanitarian situation due to conflict displacement.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provide humanitarian assistance in Pemba.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will target 60% IDPs and 40% host community members in Muripa and 3 de Fevereiro villages in Mecufi District.</narrative>
  </description>
